Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.20,0:04:41.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.20,0:04:41.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I wouldn't know off the top of my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:44.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那上面说要封到23号 我也不确定
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:44.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm assuming it'll be till the 23rd as it says over there but I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.56,0:04:45.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我是今天才来的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.56,0:04:45.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I've only been put on this today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:48.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}8月23号 我们开张那天
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:48.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}23rd of August and we're opening that day?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.92,0:04:53.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我也不知道 我是实习的 只是奉命行事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.92,0:04:53.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I wouldn't know. I'm a trainee. I just do what I'm told. Steady, steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.60,0:04:56.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}到了酒吧之后 又遇到一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.60,0:04:56.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}After getting to the pub, there was another problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.88,0:04:57.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.88,0:04:57.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.00,0:05:02.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我为了替代高价遮阳伞 而订购的遮阳篷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.00,0:05:02.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The canopy I'd ordered instead of the overpriced umbrellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.28,0:05:04.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}呃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.28,0:05:04.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.48,0:05:07.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}老天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.48,0:05:07.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Christ.
