Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.40,0:05:11.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's made this dining room unbelievably dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.60,0:05:23.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.60,0:05:23.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Bollocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:26.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这可能是个代价高昂的错误
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:26.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That could be an expensive mistake.
