Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.96,0:05:35.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}his cheerfulness then arrived with one of his budget updates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.32,0:05:36.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}呃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.32,0:05:36.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.84,0:05:37.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}无线网络
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.84,0:05:37.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Wi-Fi,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.16,0:05:39.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}专用线路
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.16,0:05:39.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}the dedicated line.
