Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:43.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}£1,000 a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.72,0:05:47.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}千兆 每月一千英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.72,0:05:47.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There's a giga... £1,000 a month?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.80,0:05:49.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 合同期是12个月
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.80,0:05:49.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, on a 12-month contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.76,0:05:50.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}老天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.76,0:05:50.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.20,0:05:53.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}停车管理员招到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.20,0:05:53.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Parking wardens have come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.84,0:05:55.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 总共六个人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.84,0:05:55.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah? Six people here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.64,0:05:58.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}每人每天两百英镑 一天就是一千两百英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.64,0:05:58.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}£200 each a day, £1,200 a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.72,0:06:00.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}每个月大概四万英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.72,0:06:00.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's about £40,000 a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.64,0:06:02.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 太离谱了 不合理 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.64,0:06:02.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, that's ridiculous. It's not sensible, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.16,0:06:09.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道我对于 总体预算最悲观的估计吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.16,0:06:09.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You know my sort of pessimistic budget on how much this was all gonna cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.64,0:06:12.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得会超出
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.64,0:06:12.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I think we might have breached that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.32,0:06:14.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.32,0:06:14.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hmm. Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.84,0:06:16.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}希望会有顾客来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.84,0:06:16.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Let's hope people come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.68,0:06:20.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这让我想到了下一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.68,0:06:20.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This brought me to my next point.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:22.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}道路施工
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:22.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Roadworks. Yeah.
