Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.68,0:06:27.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}要封到8月23号 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.68,0:06:27.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They last until the 23rd. Yes.
