Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.44,0:06:29.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We're opening on the 23rd,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.48,0:06:30.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以到时候顾客进不来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.48,0:06:30.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}so nobody will be able to come here.
