Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.88,0:06:33.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, I'm gonna speak to the contact because,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.84,0:06:36.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我不大确定为何要封闭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.84,0:06:36.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not quite sure why they've shut
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.32,0:06:38.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}从环岛到十字路口的路
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.32,0:06:38.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}the actual junction off the roundabout.
