Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.60,0:06:39.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, yeah, yeah, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.96,0:06:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你去找施工队的联络人谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.96,0:06:41.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So you're going to talk to the roadwork people?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.20,0:06:44.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 我来负责这个遮阳篷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.20,0:06:44.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. This tent is my responsibility
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.20,0:06:45.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我必须做点什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.20,0:06:45.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and I'm gonna have to do something,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.88,0:06:47.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那个房间的光线被遮挡完了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.88,0:06:47.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause there's no light in that room anymore.
