Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.56,0:06:50.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, okay, there's electrical light.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.64,0:06:53.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但以前那个房间一直是很亮堂的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.64,0:06:53.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But that room's always been so bright and sparkly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.32,0:06:55.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}而且感觉有点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.32,0:06:55.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It also feels a bit...
