Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.24,0:07:07.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I didn't think, "Wow, that's nice."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:10.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我经常会有"哇 真不错"的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:10.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And I do often think, "Wow, that's nice" to some things!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.52,0:07:13.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"我没有 哇 真不错的感觉"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.52,0:07:13.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"I didn't think, 'Wow, that's nice.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.88,0:07:17.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（距离开张还有17天）
