Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.00,0:07:35.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb came over to help me and Mark the brewer demolish the old bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.44,0:07:37.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我想把硬币拿出来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.44,0:07:37.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I want the pennies out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.36,0:07:55.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不 丽莎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.36,0:07:55.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh no, Lisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.44,0:07:58.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不 丽莎 不要这样做
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.44,0:07:58.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, Lisa, don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.48,0:08:03.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}拆掉旧吧台之后
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.48,0:08:03.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}As the old bar was taken apart,
