Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.80,0:08:09.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}the engine room of the pub, the kitchen, was starting to come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.92,0:08:19.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不错 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.92,0:08:19.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Nice. Nice one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.32,0:08:27.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}而在周边的乡村
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.32,0:08:27.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And in the surrounding countryside...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:29.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}快 快走
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.56,0:08:33.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们成立的农业合作社 正在将动物们赶到一起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.56,0:08:33.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The farming cooperative we'd formed were rounding up the animals
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.24,0:08:35.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它们即将进入厨房
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.24,0:08:35.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}that would soon go through that kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.16,0:08:52.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}经过了几个晴天
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.16,0:08:52.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}A couple of dry days later...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.96,0:08:55.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这块地 是的 我们看看这块地
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.96,0:08:55.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This field? Yeah, let's go this field.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.56,0:08:59.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看来终于可以开始收割了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.56,0:08:59.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It looked like we could finally start harvesting. Two, down low.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.28,0:09:04.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}尽管酒吧的事让我忙得不可开交 但我是不会错过这个的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.28,0:09:04.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And even though I was very busy at the pub, I wasn't gonna miss that.
