Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.32,0:23:49.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我个人的最爱 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.32,0:23:49.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}My personal favourite. And how long...
