Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.52,0:28:01.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}马克又跟我说 "我还需要一个集装箱"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.52,0:28:01.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Mark says, "I need another shipping container."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.76,0:28:07.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}问题如海啸般涌来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.76,0:28:07.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}To try and drown out the relentless questioning,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.04,0:28:11.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为了将它们的声音盖下去 我决定去干噪音最大的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.04,0:28:11.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I decided to get involved with the loudest job going.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.72,0:28:23.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}将以前的野合场所 那些歪歪斜斜 存在危险的树锯掉
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.72,0:28:23.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Removing the dangerous and wonky trees from the old dogging site.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.00,0:28:24.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（射我嘴里）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.20,0:28:33.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}把那些树锯倒后 我派出了遥控开垦机
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.20,0:28:33.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Once the trees were down, I moved in with the Robo mulcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.52,0:28:34.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}出发
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.52,0:28:34.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.52,0:28:36.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}很好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.52,0:28:36.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.24,0:28:40.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}全世界我第二喜欢的机器
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.24,0:28:40.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}My second-favourite machine in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.56,0:28:46.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 你没听错
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.56,0:28:46.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And yes, you heard that right,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.20,0:28:50.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为现在我有了新的最喜欢的机器了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.20,0:28:50.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}because I now had a new favourite machine in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.68,0:28:55.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}准备好了吗 卡莱布 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.68,0:28:55.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, are you ready, Kaleb? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.60,0:29:00.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}欢迎各位 请看树桩终结者
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.60,0:29:00.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Welcome, everyone, to the Tree Stumpinator.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.08,0:29:08.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.08,0:29:08.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.92,0:29:11.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这个必须得有
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.92,0:29:11.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You're gonna have to get one!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.96,0:29:13.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这声音
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.96,0:29:13.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The sound of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.04,0:29:20.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}下一个在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.04,0:29:20.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Where's the next one?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.16,0:29:22.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这里有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.16,0:29:22.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There's one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.12,0:29:34.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是我做过的最有满足感的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.12,0:29:34.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is the most satisfying thing I've ever done.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.24,0:29:39.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布 当深度达到二十厘米时
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.24,0:29:39.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It won't actually pull it round then, Kaleb,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.88,0:29:41.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它就不会旋转了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.88,0:29:41.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}when it's right down in a foot deep, hey?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.96,0:29:49.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}将所有树桩都切碎后 我开始做另一项与木头有关的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.96,0:29:49.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Once I'd minced all the stumps, I moved on to another wood-based job,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.68,0:29:53.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}只是这项工作要细致多了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.68,0:29:53.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}only this one was much more delicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.92,0:29:57.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你想弄成什么样
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.92,0:29:57.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What's your idea for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.72,0:29:59.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}整个天花板都弄成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.72,0:29:59.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The whole roof is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.16,0:30:00.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你打算在上面缠上小彩灯
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.16,0:30:00.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And then you're gonna put fairy lights around it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.64,0:30:02.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 缠满小彩灯
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.64,0:30:02.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, and then you run fairy lights through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.96,0:30:06.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}彩灯 钻头滑开了 见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.96,0:30:06.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The lights aren't... Shit. You've moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.76,0:30:10.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这个设计方案有女人参与吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.76,0:30:10.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Were any women involved in doing this practically?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.36,0:30:18.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么情况 所以 现在
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.36,0:30:18.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What the fuck? So now...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.72,0:30:23.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是木屑吗 我眼睛里进了好多木屑
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.72,0:30:23.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that sawdust? I've got so much sawdust in my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.88,0:30:25.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你要多大的夹子
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.88,0:30:25.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What size clip would you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.44,0:30:30.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好 来了 对直了钻
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.44,0:30:30.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, here we go. Keep it straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.00,0:30:34.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我感觉自己就像米开朗基罗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.00,0:30:34.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I feel like Michelangelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.48,0:30:36.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}可以了 杰里米 终于
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.48,0:30:36.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That'll do, Jeremy, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.36,0:30:41.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}见鬼  你这个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.36,0:30:41.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh shit. Oh, you wanker.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.52,0:30:49.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（距离银行假期开业日还有四天）
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.28,0:30:51.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}随着开业在即
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.28,0:30:51.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}With opening day fast approaching,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.44,0:30:56.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}时间正在飞速流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.44,0:30:56.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}the sand was now falling through the hourglass at an alarming rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.36,0:30:59.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}考虑到天气阴晴不定
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.36,0:30:59.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But given the stop-start nature of the weather,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.68,0:31:05.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我和卡莱布 必须抓住一切时机进行抢收
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.68,0:31:05.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb and I had to take our harvesting opportunities whenever they came along.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.32,0:31:07.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}仪器拿了吗 拿了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.32,0:31:07.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Have you got all the kit? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.40,0:31:11.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}今天看似很有希望
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.40,0:31:11.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And today was looking hopeful.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.80,0:31:13.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们来听听声音
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.80,0:31:13.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Let's have a listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.92,0:31:16.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好 你猜是多少
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.92,0:31:16.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Go on then. Do your guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.24,0:31:22.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}15.4 好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.24,0:31:22.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}15.4. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.28,0:31:24.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我来听听 好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.28,0:31:24.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna do it listening, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.36,0:31:30.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我猜是15.7
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.36,0:31:30.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna say 15.7.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.20,0:31:35.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我去 我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.20,0:31:35.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Ooh. Fucking hell. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.72,0:31:37.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}还是别让观众朋友看了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.72,0:31:37.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Let's not show the ladies and gentlemen that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.72,0:31:40.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}刚才你猜是多少来着 14 对 我猜14.1
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.72,0:31:40.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No. What did you reckon? 14? Yeah, I said 14.1.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.48,0:31:42.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我猜是14 所以 没错 我俩猜得八九不离
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.48,0:31:42.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I said 14, so. Yeah, we're both...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.48,0:31:46.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在这里 看 14.1 猜得很准
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.48,0:31:46.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Basically. 14.1. We're basically... Nailed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.28,0:31:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}根本没必要用仪器检测
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.28,0:31:47.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know why we even bother coming out testing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.96,0:31:51.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 早上我还在想"田里不会有露水 然后果然没有"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.96,0:31:51.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Exactly, we just... This morning, I thought, "There is no dew."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.00,0:31:53.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 去开拖拉机吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.00,0:31:53.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, tractors then.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.96,0:32:00.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}回到院子 我再次爬进了农用版"千年隼"号
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.96,0:32:00.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Back at the yard, I climbed once more into the rural "Millennium Falcon".
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.16,0:32:02.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}打开空调
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.16,0:32:02.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Air con back on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.24,0:32:05.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}太安静了 几乎听不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.24,0:32:05.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's so quiet and subtle, you'd barely know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.60,0:32:08.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.60,0:32:08.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.40,0:32:12.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（服务报警）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.72,0:32:14.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}出现了一条服务报警 红色服务报警
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.72,0:32:14.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Now I've got a Service Alarm, a red Service Alarm,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.92,0:32:17.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}外加黄色的中控台报警
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.92,0:32:17.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}to go with the yellow Armrest Alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.00,0:32:21.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}还有有趣的蓝色报警 看着像是尿素
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.00,0:32:21.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And this funny blue thing, which looks like it might be AdBlue
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.24,0:32:20.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（中控台报警）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.52,0:32:23.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}或空调的问题 我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.52,0:32:23.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}or air conditioning, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.68,0:32:25.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}中控台报警
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.68,0:32:25.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Armrest Alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.40,0:32:27.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.40,0:32:27.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.96,0:32:30.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}别哔哔了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.96,0:32:30.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Stop beeping!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.44,0:32:35.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}买这台拖拉机是个灾难性的错误
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.44,0:32:35.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This was a catastrophically bad buy, this tractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.12,0:32:39.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我要重新启用那台银色拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.12,0:32:39.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I am going to get my silver tractor out of retirement
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.68,0:32:42.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为它比这台要强一点
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.68,0:32:42.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}because it's better than this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.92,0:32:47.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的计划是将剩下的大麦收割完
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.92,0:32:47.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The plan was to mop up the remaining barley.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.48,0:32:51.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但是对于产量 我们没有抱太高的期望
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.48,0:32:51.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But our hopes for a good yield were not high
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.44,0:32:55.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为这块田里的杂草长疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.44,0:32:55.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}because in this field, the weeds had run amok.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.40,0:33:00.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你看
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.40,0:33:00.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.92,0:33:05.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看那里 那里本该全都是大麦的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.92,0:33:05.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, that... That's supposed to all be barley.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.16,0:33:08.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 到处都是绿色的杂草
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.16,0:33:08.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at the green weeds everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.16,0:33:10.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.16,0:33:10.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's bloody awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.72,0:33:21.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}查理已经说了 考虑到今年的恶劣天气
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.72,0:33:21.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Charlie had already said that because of this year's terrible weather,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.40,0:33:24.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}产量能达到每公顷五吨就算不错了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.40,0:33:24.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}we should be happy if we got five tons per hectare.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.60,0:33:28.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然而随着天色渐晚
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.60,0:33:28.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But as the afternoon wore on,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.64,0:33:33.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}很明显 我们连这个产量都达不到
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.64,0:33:33.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}it was clear we wouldn't even get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.92,0:33:37.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}卡哥 想不想听听这块田的产量
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.92,0:33:37.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}K, do you want me to tell you the yield or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.96,0:33:39.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不想
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.96,0:33:39.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Not really, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.36,0:33:41.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}小数点后跟个九
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.36,0:33:41.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}0.9 of a ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.28,0:33:44.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}每公顷1.9吨
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.28,0:33:44.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}1.9 a ton a hectare?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.16,0:33:47.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不是1.9 是0.9
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.16,0:33:47.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, not 1.9, 0.9.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.68,0:33:52.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}老天爷 这也
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.68,0:33:52.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Jesus Christ. That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.08,0:33:56.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}难怪拖拉机一直对着我哔个不停
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.08,0:33:56.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's why my tractor's beeping at me all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.24,0:34:00.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它在说 "收割是浪费时间 地里什么都没长"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.24,0:34:00.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It says, "You are wasting your time doing this. You haven't grown anything."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.20,0:34:12.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}天气持续晴朗 第二天我们继续收割
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.20,0:34:12.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}With the weather holding, we kept on harvesting through the next day
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.16,0:34:15.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一直干到晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.16,0:34:15.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and into the evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.52,0:34:22.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但是酒吧和收割两线作战
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.52,0:34:22.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But the effort of juggling the pub and the harvest
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.24,0:34:27.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}开始让我筋疲力竭了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.24,0:34:27.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}was now wiping me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.84,0:34:33.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}过去十天 我每天顶多只睡
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.84,0:34:33.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I've had about no more than four or five hours of sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.32,0:34:36.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}四五个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.32,0:34:36.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}for the last ten days.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.28,0:34:40.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我快撑不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.28,0:34:40.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm knackered.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.00,0:34:43.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}连着收割了两天
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.00,0:34:43.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Two days of harvesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.44,0:34:49.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后还要赶回酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.44,0:34:49.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And then back to the pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.96,0:35:00.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}关掉这个 手机静音
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.96,0:35:00.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Close that. Phone on silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.16,0:35:04.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}谁也别想找到我
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.16,0:35:04.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Nobody can get at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.92,0:35:17.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然而 这只是短暂的喘息
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.92,0:35:17.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}However, this was a brief respite.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.00,0:35:19.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（距离银行假期开业日还有两天）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.80,0:35:22.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为第二天早上 当天接到的第一通电话
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.80,0:35:22.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Because the following morning, the first phone call of the day
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.20,0:35:25.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}立刻就把我放回到了压力传送带上
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.20,0:35:25.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}put me straight back on the conveyor belt of stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.08,0:35:26.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（安妮）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.96,0:35:30.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗨 安妮 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.96,0:35:30.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hi, Annie?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.56,0:35:31.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我正要离开酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.56,0:35:31.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm just leaving the pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.04,0:35:33.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你好 情况如何
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.04,0:35:33.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello. How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.12,0:35:38.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}压力有点大 我们到了最后关头了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.12,0:35:38.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Er, it's a bit stressful. We are to the wire now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.24,0:35:40.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}厕所无法按时送过来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.24,0:35:40.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The toilets aren't gonna make it here in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.48,0:35:44.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}等到送过来了 还要用吊车吊装
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.48,0:35:44.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, and when they do get here, they're gonna be on a crane.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.56,0:35:47.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果这里停满了车 吊车就进不来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.56,0:35:47.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, and we won't get them in if the place is full of cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.28,0:35:50.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后还要用一天时间安装水管 才算把厕所装好
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.28,0:35:50.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And then there's a day's worth of plumbing needed to fit them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.48,0:35:54.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的厕所不够用 只有酒吧里有两间
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.48,0:35:54.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got no toilets for everyone. There's only the two in the pub for...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.88,0:35:57.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}只有酒吧里有两间厕所 帐篷没有厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.88,0:35:57.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There's only the two in the pub and we've got nothing for the tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.52,0:35:59.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}别处的顾客没有厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.52,0:35:59.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And we've got nothing for, you know, anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.56,0:36:03.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 别着急 好的 我会想办法的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.56,0:36:03.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, no, no, well, okay, look... I'll get on that. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.72,0:36:06.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}还有什么问题
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.72,0:36:06.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What are the other problems? And then,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.80,0:36:08.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们这边没有电工
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.80,0:36:08.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}we've had no electricians.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.52,0:36:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}昨天帐篷内发生了电涌
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.52,0:36:11.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There were power surges going on in the tent yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.48,0:36:13.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}电工还在酒吧脱不开身
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.48,0:36:13.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They're still stuck over in the pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.84,0:36:33.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}问题是电工的活还没干完
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.84,0:36:33.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The problem is the trades just haven't finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.04,0:36:35.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}还差得远
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.04,0:36:35.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They're nowhere near finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.04,0:36:40.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}布线 音响系统 电气系统
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.04,0:36:40.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The wiring. The sound system. The electrics.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.64,0:36:42.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一幅画都还没挂起来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.64,0:36:42.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We haven't hung a picture. We haven't...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.84,0:36:45.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}木工活还没做 细木工还没做 一项工作都没完成
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.84,0:36:45.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Carpentry, joinery. Everything isn't finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.84,0:36:50.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看 地毯还没清洁 我们还差得远
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.84,0:36:50.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We haven't cleaned the carpet. I mean, we're just miles away.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.92,0:36:54.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}优先事项很明确
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.92,0:36:54.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The priorities were clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.68,0:36:57.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}第一 把新吧台搭起来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.68,0:36:57.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}One, get the new bar built.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.48,0:37:02.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}第二 把电工和安装工人赶出厨房
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.48,0:37:02.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Two, get the electricians and fitters out of the kitchen
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.04,0:37:05.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}让尼克可以着手准备食物
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.04,0:37:05.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}so Nick could start prepping food.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.96,0:37:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}第三 把细木工人和装饰工人 从所有地方赶出去
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.96,0:37:11.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And three, get the joiners and decorators out of everywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.12,0:37:16.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好让苏和瑞秋把这个工地变成酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.12,0:37:16.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}so Sue and Rachel could turn this building site into a pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.52,0:37:23.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果全是这种折叠式矮桌
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.52,0:37:23.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If you have all laid-up, low-level tables,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.04,0:37:26.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}感觉就像走进了一家餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.04,0:37:26.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}it looks like just walking into a dining room.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.24,0:37:27.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们确实会在这里摆那种桌子
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.24,0:37:27.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So we are having that here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.72,0:37:30.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}锃亮的杯子 看起来很不错 显得井井有条
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.72,0:37:30.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The twinkly light off the glasses, looks great, looks nice and organised,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.12,0:37:34.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这会是你和你妈妈去吃午餐的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.12,0:37:34.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and this is where you'd come with your mum for lunch or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.40,0:37:37.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}当你走进那个酒吧 你想要见到热闹的气氛 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.40,0:37:37.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If you walked into that bar, you want to see it all buzzing, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.80,0:37:39.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}有人站在吧台前
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.80,0:37:39.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. You've got people standing at the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.40,0:37:40.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那只狗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.40,0:37:40.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.40,0:37:41.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}还有中间 地上有一只狗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.40,0:37:41.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You've got people standing in the central, a dog on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.80,0:37:44.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那个房间内有高低错落的座位
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.80,0:37:44.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And then you've got high and low seating in that room.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.48,0:37:53.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}接下来的24小时 工作进入了冲刺阶段
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.48,0:37:53.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Over the next 24 hours, work went on at a furious pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.16,0:37:57.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}往前一点
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.16,0:37:57.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Come forward a bit. Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.92,0:37:59.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后要弄成圆角方形
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.92,0:37:59.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Then we need to come round square,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.68,0:38:01.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这样当拖拉机吊起来之后就变成正方形了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.68,0:38:01.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}so when the tractor's up it's dead square.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.92,0:38:05.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们在踢着它走 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.92,0:38:05.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, we're cooking on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.80,0:38:14.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然而电工正在拼命赶工
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.80,0:38:14.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The electricians, however, were seriously struggling
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.88,0:38:16.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}争取让厨房能够投入使用
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.88,0:38:16.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}to get the kitchen operational.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.36,0:38:20.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你们估计厨房什么时候能完工
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.36,0:38:20.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Have you any idea when you're gonna be finished in the kitchen?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.48,0:38:21.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}今天 今天
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.48,0:38:21.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Today. Today.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.68,0:38:22.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}肯定能完工 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.68,0:38:22.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}100%? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.12,0:38:26.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他真的 我在催了 尼克 我在催了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.12,0:38:26.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You really, really, really, really... I'm doing it, Nick, I'm doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.36,0:38:36.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}又是筋疲力竭的一天结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.36,0:38:36.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Come the end of another knackering day,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.20,0:38:41.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我暗自祈祷天气潮湿一些 这样晚上就不用收割了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.20,0:38:41.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I was secretly praying that it'd be too wet to do an evening harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.80,0:38:43.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}无奈天不遂人愿
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.80,0:38:43.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.32,0:38:48.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我只能来到院子里 发动了兰博基尼
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.32,0:38:48.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So I had to go to the yard and fire up the Lambo.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.36,0:38:53.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我好累
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.36,0:38:53.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I am tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.76,0:38:55.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.76,0:38:55.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.00,0:38:57.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一边忙着让酒吧开张
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.00,0:38:57.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Opening a pub
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.20,0:39:01.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一边忙着收割庄稼
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.20,0:39:01.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and doing a harvest simultaneously...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.24,0:39:07.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.24,0:39:07.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.32,0:39:14.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}装了多少了 西蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.32,0:39:14.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}How are we looking, Simon?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.56,0:39:17.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}大概装了80%了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.56,0:39:17.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Er, it's about 80% full, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.84,0:39:23.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好 晚上又装了一车
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.84,0:39:23.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Now then, a nighttime load.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.00,0:39:40.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.00,0:39:40.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.84,0:39:43.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}今天可能要干个通宵了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.84,0:39:43.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This could be an all-nighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.36,0:39:46.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}事实果真如此
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.36,0:39:46.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.84,0:39:55.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（距离银行假期开业日还有一天）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.00,0:39:57.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因此第二天早上
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.00,0:39:57.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Which meant that in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.76,0:40:01.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我疲惫到了极点
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.76,0:40:01.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I was beyond frazzled.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.04,0:40:05.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我要你马上离开厨房
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.04,0:40:05.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I need you out of this kitchen now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.72,0:40:06.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 马上
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.72,0:40:06.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.40,0:40:10.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}还要弄多久 你们跟我说昨晚就能完工
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.40,0:40:10.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}How long do you need? I was told you'd be finished last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.60,0:40:12.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}还要一两个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.60,0:40:12.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Er, another hour or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.80,0:40:15.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不 你们向我保证过昨晚就能完工
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.80,0:40:15.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No. I was promised you'd be finished last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.96,0:40:18.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你们弄不完 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.96,0:40:18.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We can't get the kitchen open... Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.84,0:40:21.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}厨房就无法投入使用
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.84,0:40:21.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Until you get this finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.36,0:40:24.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你看那该死的电线
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.36,0:40:24.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, look at the fucking wiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.96,0:40:26.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我很抱歉 昨天我们说好了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.96,0:40:26.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Sorry about this. We did agree yesterday that...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.04,0:40:30.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他们信誓旦旦地跟我说昨晚就能完工
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.04,0:40:30.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I was told, 100%, they would be finished last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.88,0:40:33.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"我们会完工的" 昨晚说的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.88,0:40:33.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}He said, "We will be finished", last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.80,0:40:35.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}刚才他们又说还要一两个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.80,0:40:35.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I've just been told it's an hour or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.36,0:40:37.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}谁跟你说的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.36,0:40:37.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Who told you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.36,0:40:38.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我要澄清一下 所谓"完工"
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.36,0:40:38.70,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Can we verify that "finished"
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.70,0:40:42.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}让我们可以在厨房里做饭 意思是天花板不会裸露
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.70,0:40:42.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}for us to cook in this kitchen is no ceiling tile?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.24,0:40:43.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}比如后面那些门
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.24,0:40:43.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Like the doors back on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.72,0:40:45.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}要能够确保食物安全 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.72,0:40:45.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Like food-safe finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.72,0:40:47.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们要在这里准备食物的 不能像那样
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.72,0:40:47.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We need to prepare food in here. Yeah, not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.12,0:40:50.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不能说"对 好的" 那个不是我们的 是电工的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.12,0:40:50.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This isn't just like, "Yeah, okay." That's the electricians.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.56,0:40:52.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不 没关系 站在我们的立场 我们不关心那是谁的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.56,0:40:52.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, it's fine. From our end, we don't give a fuck whose it is, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.12,0:40:54.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}阿兰
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.12,0:40:54.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Alan?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.28,0:40:55.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们已经损失了一天的准备时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.28,0:40:55.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We've already lost one day of prep.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.08,0:40:58.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}务必在今天上午十点之前完工
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.08,0:40:58.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We've gotta be finished and out of here by 10 o'clock this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.92,0:41:01.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}瑞秋和苏的处境跟尼克差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.92,0:41:01.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Rachel and Sue were in the same boat as Nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.16,0:41:06.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果时间充裕 我们会做一次深度清洁 拆开家具包装
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.16,0:41:06.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If we had the luxury of time we would do a deep clean, unpack the furniture,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.44,0:41:08.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}把家具摆好 现在时间不够了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.44,0:41:08.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}put it in place. We're up against it, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.92,0:41:11.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们会把家具拿出来 因为需要贴上桌号
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.92,0:41:11.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So we're gonna get the furniture out to label up the table numbers
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.92,0:41:14.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}从而设置收银机 以便顾客点餐
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.92,0:41:14.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}in order to programme the tills so people can take an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.88,0:41:17.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}尽管地上乱成这样 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.88,0:41:17.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Even though the floor's a mess? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.76,0:41:19.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}电源 为什么会发生电涌
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.76,0:41:19.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Power, why have we got power surges?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.56,0:41:21.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}显然 帐篷里发生了电涌
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.56,0:41:21.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}In the tent, apparently, there's power surges.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.68,0:41:24.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}目前是这样的 我们还在排除各种故障
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.68,0:41:24.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It will be at the moment 'cause we're still finishing all the faults.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.08,0:41:27.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们有200安的电流 我知道 那下面是50安
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.08,0:41:27.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got 200 amps to share. We've got 50 going down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.00,0:41:29.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.00,0:41:29.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, that's it, we've got...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.28,0:41:31.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道什么是电涌
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.28,0:41:31.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And I don't know what a power surge is,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.44,0:41:34.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过听起来像是 从50变成10 然后又变成100
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.44,0:41:34.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}but it sounds like they've got 50 and then 10 and then 100.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.28,0:41:36.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 那是因为这边出故障了 我们正在设法解决
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.28,0:41:36.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's 'cause it's faulty up this end and we're just trying to suss that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.60,0:41:45.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}行了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.60,0:41:45.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Can you press it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.44,0:41:53.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这次电工说到做到
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.44,0:41:53.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The electricians were true to their word this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.76,0:41:55.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（伍泽尔 连接乡村）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.40,0:41:57.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}到了十点左右 厨房已经腾出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.40,0:41:57.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and by mid-morning had vacated the kitchen
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.20,0:42:00.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}做饭的人可以进厨房了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.20,0:42:00.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}so it could be filled with cooking people.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.56,0:42:04.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}尼克 11点
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.56,0:42:04.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Nick? 11 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.56,0:42:06.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.56,0:42:06.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.24,0:42:07.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好久不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.24,0:42:07.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.88,0:42:09.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 她还有呼吸 船长
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.88,0:42:09.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"She's breathing, captain. She's breathing."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.36,0:42:11.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我来准备洋葱
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.36,0:42:11.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I've got the onions. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.80,0:42:14.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}虽然有所耽搁 不过很快地
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.80,0:42:14.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And not before time, because soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.84,0:42:19.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}农业合作社的成员们陆续把货送来了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.84,0:42:19.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}members of the farming cooperative started to arrive with supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.52,0:42:21.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}鸡蛋 给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.52,0:42:21.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Eggs? For you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.16,0:42:23.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}有凯克比先生 鸡蛋放哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.16,0:42:23.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There was Mr Cacklebean. Where would you like 'em, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.16,0:42:25.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}放到厨房
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.16,0:42:25.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}In the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.44,0:42:27.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嘿 艾玛 你好 早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.44,0:42:27.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hey, Emma. How are you? Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.64,0:42:29.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}有乳品农场的艾玛
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.64,0:42:29.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Emma from the dairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.24,0:42:31.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是牛奶吗 这是你的牛奶 对
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.24,0:42:31.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So this is milk? So this is your milk, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.80,0:42:33.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}最好赶紧放进冷藏柜
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.80,0:42:33.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Better get it in the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.00,0:42:35.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}以及蔬菜农场的伊莫金
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.00,0:42:35.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And Imogen from the vegetable farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.68,0:42:39.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我给你送了一些土豆来
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.68,0:42:39.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Ta-da! I brought you some potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.08,0:42:41.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.08,0:42:41.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.84,0:42:44.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我给你们送土豆来了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.84,0:42:44.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Ahem. I bring you potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.52,0:42:46.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好极了 干得好 伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.52,0:42:46.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Wonderful. Well done, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.44,0:42:50.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}尼克 照这个数量计算 我们需要多久送一次货
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.44,0:42:50.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Nick? How often will we need deliveries of this size?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.64,0:42:55.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}等酒吧走上正轨后 我们每周需要超过半吨
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.64,0:42:55.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I think when this is rolling along properly we'll get through more than half a ton a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.52,0:42:58.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}大概每周需要750公斤
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.52,0:42:58.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I think we're probably looking at about seven fifty kilo a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.96,0:43:00.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过这让我很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.96,0:43:00.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This makes me so happy though,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.08,0:43:02.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}两年前
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.08,0:43:02.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}to actually, after two years,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.76,0:43:06.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我第一次跟伊莫金谈起 成立合作社的事
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.76,0:43:06.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}when I first spoke to Imogen about can we get a cooperative going,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.44,0:43:09.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在终于看到 你给我们的餐厅送土豆了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.44,0:43:09.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}to actually have you delivering potatoes to our restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.88,0:43:13.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 这让我心花怒放
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.88,0:43:13.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Is... It just makes my heart sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.96,0:43:15.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过我们要支持英国农业
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.96,0:43:15.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But we're here to back British farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.76,0:43:17.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们必须使用英国的黑胡椒
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.76,0:43:17.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We're having to use British black pepper.
