Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.52,0:43:19.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's... How much is it? £100?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.12,0:43:22.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一百英镑一公斤 而不是十英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.12,0:43:22.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}£100 a kilo. As opposed to ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.76,0:43:26.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那土豆泥就不放黑胡椒了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.76,0:43:26.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There'll be no black pepper in the mashed potato then?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.56,0:43:27.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不 要放 放一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.56,0:43:27.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh no, there will. Probably a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.72,0:43:31.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}康沃尔郡种植的黑胡椒 就放几粒
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.72,0:43:31.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There'll be Cornish-grown, like... Dink! Dink!
