Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.00,0:43:43.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.32,0:43:46.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为了帮助他们进入状态
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.32,0:43:46.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And in order to get them settled,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.20,0:43:51.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}苏和瑞秋针对这些Z世代 开了一个人力资源部式的动员会
