Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.48,0:43:56.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我最想看到的是灿烂的笑容 积极的心态
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.48,0:43:56.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The main thing I'm after is a massive smile, a positive mental attitude,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.56,0:43:59.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"我能行"的态度 以及同事情谊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.56,0:43:59.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}a can-do attitude, and camaraderie.
