Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.20,0:44:07.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们希望大家有安全感 能够出色地完成工作
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.20,0:44:07.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And we do want you to feel really secure and able to do your jobs really well.
