Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.28,0:44:46.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}周围有很多别的酒吧 可以满足你的需要"
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.28,0:44:46.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}plenty of other pubs around the place that can help you out with that."
