Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.12,0:46:58.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But isn't that a fucking roof feature? It looks amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.28,0:47:01.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}把它放在酒吧里太浪费了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.28,0:47:01.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It seems such a waste to put it in the pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.40,0:47:03.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}挂在天花板上浪费吗 我知道 但是
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.40,0:47:03.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But hanging from the ceiling? I know but...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.72,0:47:05.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}太好看了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.72,0:47:05.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Looks awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.48,0:47:09.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}有这种东西的酒吧没几家
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.48,0:47:09.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, very few pubs have these.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.36,0:47:11.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}挂在天花板上 他竟然在上面打广告
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.36,0:47:11.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, from a ceiling. Look, he's even got his advert on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.80,0:47:14.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看啊 他是个可悲的小矮人 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.80,0:47:14.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at that. He is a tragic little man, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.68,0:47:19.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看着点 宽得很 是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.68,0:47:19.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look at it. Oh, there's loads of room, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.16,0:47:20.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.16,0:47:20.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.24,0:47:30.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过还有很多工作要做
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.24,0:47:30.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But there was still plenty of work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.52,0:47:31.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（下午7点）
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.60,0:47:33.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们将一直干到晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.60,0:47:33.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And we'd be going well into the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.44,0:47:36.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但在过去的48小时内
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.44,0:47:36.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But over the last 48 hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.04,0:47:41.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这支不可思议的队伍创造了一个奇迹
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.04,0:47:41.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}this incredible team of people had pulled off a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.24,0:47:46.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}捣碎器
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.24,0:47:46.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Mmm! Masher.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.60,0:47:48.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那是用来制作酥饼的吧 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.60,0:47:48.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's for the crumble? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.48,0:47:49.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}苹果酥
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.48,0:47:49.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Apple crumble.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.52,0:47:53.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.52,0:47:53.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look! Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.64,0:47:55.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}艾莉亚和珊莎
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.64,0:47:55.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Aw! Arya and Sans!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.88,0:47:57.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}理查德·汉姆  狗狗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.88,0:47:57.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Richard Ham!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.08,0:48:01.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}理查德·汉姆 带着它的小黑眼圈
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.08,0:48:01.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Richard Ham! With his little black eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.60,0:48:03.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（啤酒花与排骨）
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.16,0:48:06.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你看
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.16,0:48:06.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, wow. Look. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.56,0:48:08.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们有一间像模像样的肉店了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.56,0:48:08.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got an actual butcher's shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.80,0:48:10.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你看这些肉 我的老天
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.80,0:48:10.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But check out this meat. Holy Mother of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.32,0:48:12.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是不是很美
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.32,0:48:12.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Isn't that beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.80,0:48:16.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们看了丽莎新开的农场商店
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.80,0:48:16.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We then went to look at Lisa's new farm shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.84,0:48:19.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}挺不错的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.84,0:48:19.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Ta-da! Rather nice, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.68,0:48:20.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}蜡烛 到了早上
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.68,0:48:20.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Candles. So in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.92,0:48:23.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这里将摆满面包 糕点和现烤的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.92,0:48:23.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}this will all be bread and pastries.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.84,0:48:26.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以卖你的香水了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.84,0:48:26.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And you can actually sell your scents,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.20,0:48:30.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不会有西牛津郡地区政务委员会冲你嚷嚷了 还有T恤 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.20,0:48:30.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}without having West Oxfordshire District Council shouting at you, and T-shirts.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.28,0:48:36.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}楼上有人吗 有
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.28,0:48:36.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Is anyone upstairs? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.84,0:48:39.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}可以把我的树枝灯打开吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.84,0:48:39.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Can you just turn my tree lights on?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.60,0:48:41.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.60,0:48:41.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's got...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.44,0:48:48.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"上帝说 要有光 然后就有了光" 太漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.44,0:48:48.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And God said, "Let there be light," and there was light, and it is beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.32,0:48:52.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}拖拉机吊起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.32,0:48:52.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Tractor's up. Bar's...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.00,0:48:54.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}量酒器也挂起来了 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.00,0:48:54.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Optics are up! That's brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.08,0:48:57.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}明天午餐时间之前能准备就绪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.08,0:48:57.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, this is... We're gonna have this ready by tomorrow lunchtime?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.12,0:48:59.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没问题 肯定能行
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.12,0:48:59.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, yeah. Yeah, it's definite?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.12,0:49:02.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 地毯很脏
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.12,0:49:02.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, okay, the carpet's filthy,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.12,0:49:04.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一团糟
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.12,0:49:04.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}that's a mess,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.72,0:49:09.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过这边有酒吧的样子了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.72,0:49:09.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}but it's looking like a pub in here
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.16,0:49:12.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那边也有餐厅的样子了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.16,0:49:12.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and it's looking like a restaurant in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.12,0:49:15.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我知道 也许是我心存侥幸
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.12,0:49:15.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So I know this is... I'm probably tempting fate here,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.52,0:49:20.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但我谨慎乐观地认为 明天中午之前
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.52,0:49:20.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}but I am cautiously optimistic that this will be ready
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.08,0:49:23.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这里将准备就绪
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.08,0:49:23.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}by midday tomorrow.
